{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/draft && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nsub={\\\"action\\\":\\\"review\\\",\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Semantic review of the promoted-leader variant check for C6-recovery-ignores-committed-reply-when-promoted (artifact f2523a67a7e94950b0eacff7c280a42a, executed as 4e8a4b74…). The item assesses requirement versus predicate, the variant's legality and substitution, the oracle, identity, the observation path and the counterevidence, and it keeps C1's confirmed scope separate.\\\",\n \\\"artifact_id\\\":\\\"f2523a67a7e94950b0eacff7c280a42a\\\",\n \\\"review_items\\\":[{\n  \\\"aspect\\\":\\\"checker_correspondence\\\",\n  \\\"status\\\":\\\"no_issue_found\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S14-recovery-start-prepare\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\",\\\"S13-handleCommit\\\",\\\"S33-aws-config\\\",\\\"S31-master-startup\\\"],\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"被提升为 leader 的副本同样忽略已提交回复\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"在提升变体下（IsLeader=true、maxRecvBallot=5），恢复者的新 ballot 为 6 并作为自身 VBallot 上报，对端 vbal=0 的 COMMITTED 回复被跳过（adopted_committed=false），接受轮完成（accept_oks 0→1），恢复者以 NOOP 提交而对端保持 PUT（vectors_match=false、all_committed_match=false），应用状态同样分叉。该结论属于 C6（仅限提升变体），C1 的已确认范围保持不变。\\\",\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Requirement versus predicate: claim C6 asserts that a replica the deployment promoted to leader must adopt a reply reporting the instance COMMITTED, and the three properties assert adoption at the resolution, the recoverer-versus-peer comparison and agreement after the Commit broadcast; the retained stream shows the seed with is_leader true, max_recv_ballot 5 and the self VBallot 6, then adopted_committed false together with the derived comparisons, so the predicates are evaluated on printed fields. Entry and variant legality: the master designates a leader in the shipped configuration and calls Replica.BeTheLeader on it, which sets IsLeader; makeBallot then raises the new ballot past maxRecvBallot, and startRecoveryForInstance reports that raised ballot as the replica's own VBallot, so the variant differs from the reviewed non-promoted case only in the ballot value while the comparison that skips older-vbal replies is unchanged. Oracle and identity: the same assertions, prerequisite and instance identity correlation as the non-promoted artifact. Observation path and completion: the harness drives the queued rounds and re-reads InstanceSpace after each delivery, as in the reviewed version. Contrary evidence and alternatives: the reservation that the deployment flag might change the outcome is answered by this run, and the remaining reservations are recorded as limitations, namely that a real ballot history is modelled as one maxRecvBallot value, that the master's promotion is a sourced premise rather than an executed step, and that the committed record is prepared. C1's confirmed scope (IsLeader false) is untouched and this claim covers only the promoted variant.\\\",\n  \\\"limitations\\\":[\\\"a real promoted replica's ballot history is modelled as a single maxRecvBallot value; the run exercises the raising loop's effect, not a long history\\\",\n   \\\"the master's promotion is grounded in the master and configuration sources but is not executed in the harness\\\",\n   \\\"the peer's committed record is prepared and the recovery is entered directly, as in the non-promoted check\\\"]}]}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-review-c6.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd .. && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-review-c6.json 2>&1 | head -10\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
